{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44929","headline":"哭张籍司业 · 无可","name":"哭张籍司业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生抱衰疾，不起茂陵间。\n夕临诸孤少，荒居吊客还。\n遗文禅东岳，留语葬乡山。\n多雨铭旌故，残灯素帐闲。\n乐章谁与集，壠树即堪攀。\n神理今难问，予将呌帝关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}